OL,3,GNEWSASuicide rate rise in Coventry
OL,4,Asparks concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FConcerns have been raised about a rise
OL,7,Fin suicide rates across Coventry.
OL,9,FFigures released in the West Midlands
OL,10,FState of the Region 2026 report show
OL,11,Fthe number of deaths by suicide in the
OL,12,Fcity has risen from about 8.6 per
OL,13,F100,000 people in 2021-23 to 11.8 in
OL,14,F2022-24.
OL,16,FThat means Coventry now has the highest
OL,17,Frate in the West Midlands, raising
OL,18,Fconcerns from politicians and charities
OL,19,Fabout why the numbers are going up.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,355,350,200,160,0,100
